{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那日，七個女人將拉著一個男人，說：「我們吃自己的，穿自己的，只求你娶我們，讓我們歸在你名下，除掉我們的羞辱。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的復興"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那日，耶和華的苗必長得茂盛華美，這地方的出產必成為以色列倖存者的驕傲和光榮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["主必以審判的靈和焚燒的靈洗淨錫安女子的污穢，清除耶路撒冷的血跡。所有錫安剩餘的人，即留在耶路撒冷、名字記錄在生命冊上的人都將被稱為聖潔的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華必在日間造煙雲遮蔽整個錫安山和那裡的會眾，在夜間造火光照亮他們。祂的榮耀必遮蓋一切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["必有白日避暑的亭子，躲避狂風暴雨的避難所和藏身處。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}